	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Nuper unas ex <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> literas recepi datas ad dominum <persName ref="p1283">Gesnerum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quas ut tradas rogo.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Bellum inter <placeName ref="l830">Angliam</placeName> et <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName> gliscit; <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nam <persName ref="p8375">Anglię</persName> regina <placeName ref="l2524">Scotos</placeName> vicinos et coniunctos propter <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>religionem susceptam a <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> oppugnatos indefensos relinquere <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>non vult.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nam sub prętextu religionis bellum ceptum a <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> in <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>totius insulę suppressionem directum est.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l875">Hispaniarum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>quoque rex sub hiis spetiosis titulis, nempe hęreseos et rebellionis <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>in armorum societatem adducitur immemor antiquissimorum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>fęderum et sępius acceptorum benefitiorum a priscis et nostri <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ęvi <persName ref="p8375">Anglię</persName> regibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l822">Germanos</placeName> veros et memores sui <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>officii spes est non militaturos in hoc nefando bello <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Si <placeName ref="l862">Helvetii</placeName> quoque detrectarent impia arma induere et gladios <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>in innoxios stringere, nihil regem pręclari perfecturum verismile <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>esset.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Regina et terra et mari suas copias admovit ad <placeName ref="l2524">Scotiam</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>et nisi <placeName ref="l832">Gallię</placeName> rex ęquissimas conditiones et accipiat et det, regina <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Scotię libertatem armis asserere annitetur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">De reginę connubio <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>nihildum accepi; maior natu <placeName>Suetię</placeName> regis in <placeName ref="l830">Angliam</placeName> adventurus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>dicitur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Orator Cesaris ibidem quoque hęret; verum an exorator [<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>fu]turus sit, plęrique dubitant.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Fertur reginam inter horrida <lb xml:id="p1z21"/><persName>Martis</persName> arma tristes hymenęos facere nolle, ne liberatori magis <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>necessitate coacta nupsisse quam delecto coniugi dicatur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Religio in <lb xml:id="p1z23"/><placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> fęlices successus habet, qui ut quotidie magis fęlices sint, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>deus implorandus est.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Quęso, ut me commendes d. <persName ref="p8111">Martyri</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Bene valeas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Ar<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>ge<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>n<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ti<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>n<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ę</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
